{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/7f0bbb170dec29e74ab866fa2c07b493.avif?t=1768072190\" alt=\"Horde Slayer, 4 player co-op\" width=616 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horde Slayer\u00a0</strong>is an <i>online co-op or solo roguelite RPG</i> where you battle endless hordes of monsters across unsacred, cursed lands. Face the darkness alone, or join forces with up to three allies to purge evil together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/cfd0e0745d6db9faf97911d3f807027a.poster.avif?t=1768072190\" aria-label=\"Hero Classes\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/cfd0e0745d6db9faf97911d3f807027a.webm?t=1768072190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/cfd0e0745d6db9faf97911d3f807027a.mp4?t=1768072190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard</strong> - Command the raw power of fire, frost, and arcane magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranger</strong> - Strike from afar with your trusty bow and clever traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slayer</strong> - Cleave through foes with steel and brute strength, right in the heart of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/2559424924a0b93b3c18e2d0c68d28da.poster.avif?t=1768072190\" aria-lab